      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e85040a49697012e90faba3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，我跟草上飞告别后，\n回到了训练员宿舍……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7af44c18cb4bcec2b83077778c5c637216fe26fb5d4a86f6e773dd49ba47c86a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6448dd6ca7028c91ef521d6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和抚子一般的马娘，草上飞。和颜悦色笑着\r\n泡茶的她，到底能跑出怎样的成绩呢――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7999f572ede29662a2fde3d50bc34c8186067e985a80ccb3a9571ac4fbdd4b3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3556b6fdfd07e87345124d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这份疑问，似乎很快就能得到答案了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "128c821d82b7ceee02531d56d964f7b5bf753c04518e590c27824f017f32e445",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:090900335c6a5eb13cc362c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『给训练员们的通知。\n选拔赛举办之际的联络』",
      "source_fingerprint": "232cefd06e82cc609b84fde0b1399785d4dfe160b76af264304a35a692dffcb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbf286667485ec71b31f3893",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那份邮件中的参赛登记表上――\r\n写着『草上飞』的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "108e6f129bbeddb8569586c057a89d70aa7d1c5d9d4736e97ff134806621bfc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1011/storytimeline_041011001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:352184029cc0ee5ef77b6e6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3ba1631152984791543a0369db2cd482292820d8f58be72b12657fe41e9879",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
