    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a8a9519ad91761f34bfb4a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个孩子，是草上飞……是吗？　明明处在大舞台，却也相当\r\n冷静啊！　那种精神力量，可以说是相当有力的武器呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6902b34cd71ae0d2cac902aa31bc7a166400c6c39abe07b75430c2381f9ed7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
