      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，那孩子不仅是心理素质方面……从迄今为止的成绩来\r\n看，她身体素质也相当不错，是最后一组的大本命呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c38e2639828c60f7638a83bdbff41472150ee5588bcc483c5fda0b9e09ae5f83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
