      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，抱歉。\n毕竟那是令人记忆深刻的一天，所以就～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0adac69edbe4687b4ca545164ee558f3a0e61a2a04e86135a61e55384bc0cb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
